PDFRenderV
==========

A native PDF renderer and previewer for RISC OS 5.  As well as PDFs
it opens JPEG, PNG, Sprite and Draw files in the same window, with
the same zoom and printing, so one viewer covers everything.

Installation
------------
Drop !PDFRenderV anywhere the boot sequence scans (Boot:^.Apps, or
add it to Configure > Boot > Look at), or simply open its parent
directory once per session.  Its !Boot loads the PDFRenderV module
and claims the PDF filetype (&ADF), so double-clicking any PDF opens
it in the viewer.

Viewer
------
  <  n/N  >     previous / next page
  -  zoom%  +   zoom from 25% to 400%
  Print         print the current page through the printer driver

Commands
--------
  *PDFInfo <file>
        report version, page count and page sizes
  *PDFToSprite <file> <page> <spritefile> [<width>]
        render a page to a 32bpp sprite file
  *PDFRenderVOpen <file>
        open a PDF in the viewer (what the Filer uses)

